# 统一文本文件换行为 LF，避免 Windows (core.autocrlf=true) 检出时
# 引入 CRLF，导致 RSC Flight 文本行字节长度前缀与部署后字节不一致。
# 详见 docs/bugfix-rsc-enqueueModel.md
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做换行处理
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
